{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6346","title":"POCO Unveils POCO F9 Series with All-Round Flagship Power and 185FPS Gaming Experience","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today unveiled POCO F9 Ultra and POCO F9 Pro, continuing the F Series' legacy in the premium flagship market.","view_cnt":"1870","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1788003629","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/407_operatorx_operatorx_opx/29/08/2026/b8dd15eba77073d056286a8a3faf90d0.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, September 1, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e — POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today unveiled POCO F9 Ultra and POCO F9 Pro, continuing the F Series' legacy in the premium flagship market. Built for ultimate performance, POCO F9 Series delivers a major technological leap in gaming and brings all-round upgrades in display, imaging, and battery life, showcasing flagship excellence on every front. During the launch, POCO also announced the next chapter of its partnership with Bose, a global leader in audio, to deliver clear, immersive, and high-quality mobile audio experiences to users worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\"As POCO continues to strengthen its position in the premium flagship segment, we remain focused on challenging conventions through technologies and innovations,\" said Kang Lou, Senior Product Marketing Manager and Spokesperson at POCO Global. \"With POCO F9 Ultra, we're delivering ultimate performance through cutting-edge technologies and gaming innovations, while POCO F9 Pro brings together flagship gaming power and a well-balanced, versatile experience for more users. Together, POCO F9 Series is designed to meet the expectations of a more demanding and diverse audience, delivering peak performance and exceptional value.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUltra Performance Unleashes 185FPS Gaming Dominance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePerformance stands at the core of POCO F9 Series, with its flagship dual-chip architecture raising the performance bar for all-round flagships. Both devices are built on Qualcomm's latest flagship mobile platforms, delivering unmatched performance and speed across intensive multitasking, demanding workloads, and gaming. Leading the lineup, POCO F9 Ultra is powered by the Snapdragon® 8 Elite Gen 5 Mobile Platform and delivers an impressive AnTuTu score of 4,165,108¹—the highest ever recorded on a POCO smartphone. Taking charge of visual processing, for the first time in F Series, both models pair their flagship processors with the dedicated VisionBoost D8 chipset, enabling Smart frame rate² at up to an industry-leading 185FPS.³ Moreover, Smart frame rate² and AI Super resolution⁴ can run simultaneously, delivering smoother motion and sharper detail for a more lifelike gaming experience. POCO F9 Ultra also features ultra storage up to 1TB,⁵ providing ample space for all the games, apps, and media content without compromise.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBeyond hardware, POCO F9 Series integrates WildBoost Engine to further elevate the gaming experience. A standout capability is support for gaming at an ultra-high 185FPS.³ Compared with 120FPS, it delivers 65 more frames per second, and a refresh interval shortened by 3ms, allowing users to spot enemies earlier and react faster. This extreme fluidity is available natively across over 20 titles,⁶ while 5 additional games can reach 185FPS³ through Smart frame rate². Complementing this, Game Color Enhancement⁷ further enables precise tuning of game visuals for vivid graphics and enhanced scene details. Matching these visuals, a 4,800Hz instant touch sampling rate,⁸ 480Hz 10-point touch sampling rate,⁹ and an ultra-high 200Hz gyro sampling rate¹⁰ translate every tap, swipe, and tilt into fast, precise control.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/114_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/b7cb4f07b4cc5b252cf59e4c71329a7f.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO 3D IceLoop cooling system rounds out the performance experience, helping the entire lineup remain smooth and stable for longer—even during demanding gaming sessions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/484_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/13867efabd407e19c450b12f64fe8d78.jpg\" alt=\"The image shows the internal structure of a mobile phone, highlighting a glowing heat dissipation component, surrounded by blue and orange lighting effects, with a black background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Visuals, Refined by Design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO F9 Series features ultra-high 185Hz POCO HyperRGB AMOLED displays,¹¹ delivering exceptionally fluid visuals across various scenarios. POCO F9 Ultra opens up the experience on an expansive 6.9-inch screen,¹² while POCO F9 Pro packs the same flagship display technology into a more compact 6.59-inch form factor for comfortable handling. At the heart of both displays is POCO HyperRGB technology. Its full RGB subpixel structure makes full use of every red, green, and blue subpixel to deliver crisp, vibrant visuals comparable to a 2K display, while consuming less power. The lineup also marks the global debut of the new M11 luminescent material, enabling up to 4,500 nits of peak brightness across multiple scenarios and 10,000 nits for HDR content,¹³ bringing dazzling highlights, deeper contrast, and finer detail to every scene.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/574_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/d8c77688a38e078b02b037780d2d897c.jpg\" alt=\"A mobile phone is resting on a black background, reflecting light on the screen, showcasing its smooth surface and delicate design.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eComfort matters as much as clarity. POCO F9 Series introduces Xiaomi Vision Care, POCO's first comprehensive eye care solution, achieving TÜV Rheinland Quadruple Eye Care certification.¹⁴ Whether it's a long reading session, back-to-back videos, or a late-night scroll, POCO F9 Series helps to ease eye fatigue.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBoth models embrace a refined, premium design language with a sophisticated look and feel. POCO F9 Ultra introduces a dynamic light on the back, offering personalized effects for incoming calls, notifications, gaming, and music, while giving the device a distinctive visual signature. POCO F9 Pro brings POCO's first full-panel luminous design¹⁵ to the Aurora Green variant, producing a soft, even glow in darkness after exposure to sunlight or indoor lighting,¹⁶ and allowing users to create their own luminous patterns with a blue-violet laser pointer¹⁷.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/479_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/77d4cc732a2acabf92b7323a7405b566.jpg\" alt=\"The back of a green mobile phone, equipped with three cameras, with a background of gradient green lines, showcasing dynamism and a modern feel.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSound by Bose Technology: Deepening the Partnership for Premium Mobile Acoustics\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO F9 Series takes the premium audio experience further through state-of-the-art hardware and software, as well as joint acoustic tuning powered by Sound by Bose technology. POCO F9 Ultra combines dual symmetrical 1115D master-grade stereo speakers with an ultra-large 1620 independent subwoofer to create a true 2.1-channel audio experience,¹⁸ delivering a more stable sound image, deeper bass, and a wider soundstage.¹⁹ Alternatively, POCO F9 Pro features dual symmetrical 1115F super-linear stereo speakers paired with a Sealed Cavity Design,¹⁸ producing rich midrange, crisp high frequencies, and finely rendered detail across the full frequency range.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/26_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/6e7e4274b98c21fa108f038609e4f28d.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBeyond hardware, two professionally tuned sound profiles are available across the lineup, offering distinct listening experiences: \"Dynamic\" for authentic and full bass character, and \"Balanced\" for overall balanced and pure vocals. Furthermore, Sound by Bose powered tuning delivers detailed sound at low volumes and distortion-free sound at high volumes, restoring an authentic listening experience at every volume level.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThis collaboration also brings a new mobile gaming experience to both devices with the all-new Game audio mode.²⁰ It increases footstep loudness for clearer directional awareness, while retaining the layered detail of gunfire, voices, and other in-game effects. As a result, players can identify critical audio cues more easily, pinpoint their direction more accurately, and stay fully immersed in the game.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUltra Battery Capacity Meets Full-Speed HyperCharge\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO F9 Series delivers exceptional real-world endurance engineered for power users. POCO F9 Ultra features the largest battery ever in the POCO F Series—an 8,050mAh (typ) battery with 16% silicon-carbon content that ensures high energy density in a streamlined form factor, providing reliable 2-day battery life.²¹ POCO F9 Pro houses a substantial 6,330mAh (typ) battery, ensuring all-day battery life while maintaining a compact profile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThe versatile HyperCharge system combines 100W wired²² and 50W wireless HyperCharge²³ across the entire lineup, delivering rapid power recovery. Both models also support industry-leading 27W wired and 22.5W wireless reverse charging,²⁴ turning the phone into a convenient power source for other devices.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/596_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/79a7bf4e83cee125ef76bc79c35782cd.jpg\" alt=\"A mobile phone is charging, displaying a battery level of 86.35%, with a black background and a golden light effect.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOCO's First 200MP Ultra-Clear Imaging with Flagship Versatility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTaking a major step forward in imaging, POCO F9 Series introduces POCO's first-ever 200MP ultra-clear camera system, equipped with OIS across both models. A dedicated 200MP mode captures exceptional detail, unlocking greater creative freedom in cropping, reframing, and post-capture editing. Complementing the rear setup, a crisp 32MP front camera ensures every self-portrait remains sharp and refined.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/580_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/01/09/2026/d526d8bf2ef7366d3a3ae234e57bf308.jpg\" alt=\"Young people are sitting outdoors playing the guitar, smiling, wearing casual clothes, with a pot of green plants and a table beside them, on which there are cans of drinks. The sun is shining brightly, and the background features modern architecture.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFor long-range shooting, POCO F9 Ultra features a flagship 5x periscope telephoto camera that brings distant subjects into sharp, effortless focus. Together with 10x lossless zoom and 20x AI Ultra Zoom, it captures sharp, jitter-free detail across every scenario. Alternatively, POCO F9 Pro features a 50MP 2.5x floating telephoto camera that focuses from as close as 10cm, moving effortlessly from super macro close-ups to faraway landscapes. Across the entire lineup, Live cinematography brings a cinematic touch to video with 4K ultra HD capture, automated focal transitions, and fluid lens shifts that turn everyday moments into compelling visual stories.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO F9 Ultra is available in two colors: Dark Cherry and Black\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be available in three variants: 12GB+256GB, 16GB+512GB, and 16GB+1TB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO F9 Pro is available in three colors: White, Aurora Green, and Black\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 12GB+256GB and 12GB+512GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third-party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ Data tested based on AnTuTu V11.1.1 by POCO Internal Labs at an ambient temperature around 25℃. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² Smart frame rate is supported in games, including but not limited to all games covered under the game category of the GetApps/Mi App Mall. Features may vary depending on the software version. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ 185FPS refers to the maximum frame rate in selected games under internal test conditions. Actual frame rate may vary depending on game title, graphics settings, software version, network conditions, temperature and other factors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁴ AI Super Resolution currently only supports Call of Duty, Genshin Impact, Honkai: Star Rail, Mobile Legends: Bang Bang, and PUBG Mobile, please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁵ Available storage is less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁶ 185FPS game list and quantity may vary depending on the region and actual conditions. Please refer to your actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁷ This feature is supported only by selected games. Please refer to your actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁸ 4800Hz instant touch sampling rate is activated under Game Turbo Mode. Actual performance may be slightly different under different application interfaces and game image qualities. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁹ To activate, go to Game Turbo -\u0026gt; Performance -\u0026gt; Enhanced Touch Control and set \"Gesture Tracking\" to \"High\". This enables the maximum multi-finger touch sampling rate of up to 480Hz. Actual performance may vary slightly depending on the specific testing environment and software versions. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁰ Supports a gyro sampling rate of up to 200Hz. To activate, go to Game Turbo -\u0026gt; Gyro boost. Actual performance may vary slightly depending on the specific testing environment and specific game software versions. Please refer to the actual experience. This feature is supported only by selected games and is available via OTA starting from September, 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹¹ The screen supports a maximum refresh rate of 185Hz. The screen refresh rate may be slightly different under different application interfaces and game image qualities. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹² The screen size of POCO F9 Ultra is about 6.85 inches in the full rectangle when measured diagonally. Actual viewable area is less due to the curved corner design and measurements between individual products may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹³ Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. 4500 nits peak brightness measured at 25% APL and 10000 nits peak brightness measured at 1% APL. Actual results may vary depending on testing environment, and software version, please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁴ This product is not a medical device. Its features are not intended for medical use and are not intended to predict, diagnose, prevent, or cure any disease.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁵ Full-panel luminous design is exclusive to POCO F9 Pro Aurora Green variant. Full-panel refers specifically to the back cover of the product and does not include the camera deco.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁶ Monochromatic light sources with wavelengths \u0026lt;390 nm or \u0026gt;450 nm produce a weak luminous effect and are not recommended. Luminous brightness and afterglow duration may vary depending on the intensity and duration of exposure to the activating light source, as well as ambient brightness, viewing angles, and other environmental factors. The luminous effect may vary across different batches, and this does not affect normal use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁷ Blue-violet laser pointer is sold separately.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁸ Symmetrical refers to the speaker components, not the exterior design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁹ Speaker specifications and loudness are based on POCO Lab tests. Actual results may vary depending on the environment or software version. Please refer to the actual product.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁰ Game audio mode is available via OTA starting from September, 2026, and is supported only by selected games, please refer to your actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²¹ The 2-day battery life is based on test results from POCO Internal Labs, measured under a simulated, comprehensive battery life scenario reflecting daily use (including typical smartphone activities such as home screen use, music playback, social media, email, maps, video streaming, standby, etc.). Actual results may vary due to differences in the testing environment, software version, network conditions, and individual usage patterns.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²² 100W HyperCharge means the adapter output power is 100W. Actual power output may vary depending on the environment. Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²³ Wireless chargers are sold separately. Availability may vary by country/region. Please check your local website or consult retailer for more information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁴ Supports up to 27W wired reverse charging and up to 22.5W wireless reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through POCO Internal Labs. Actual performance may vary depending on battery condition and other factors. Ensure your phone has sufficient charge and that the receiving device is compatible.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"69","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1788266703"},"common":null}